# Conditions composees (OU de ET, not, else) : test de player/apple2 (make hosttest).
# Sorties attendues : voir check_conditions.py.

@title T
@start a
@flag x
@flag y
@item i "Objet"
@stat N 5 0 9

:: a
~ set x
Depart.
* [go] -> b

:: b
{(flag x or flag y) and has i} A : (x ou y) et i.
{else and not flag y} B : sinon, et pas y.
{else} C : sinon.
{not (flag x and flag y)} D : pas (x et y).
{not stat N >= 6} E : N < 6.
* {(flag x and not has i) or flag y} [1 : (x et non i) ou y] -> c
* {else} [2 : else] -> c
* {not flag x or flag y} [3 : non x ou y] -> c

:: c
~ give i
* [suite] -> d

:: d
{(flag x or flag y) and has i} A : (x ou y) et i.
{else and not flag y} B
{else} C : sinon.
* {(flag x and not has i) or flag y} [1] -> w
* {else} [2 : else] -> w

:: w
@ending win
Fin.
